{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "835d389d-eb4f-8942-bc45-6b8ab08f577b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T13:07:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Brownell",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:04:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, this is Ellen Brownell. I manage the property at 292 Bridge Street, down the Point. I'm calling about the storm drain out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:04:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's grunting. That's the only word for it. It's slow, it gurgles, and any time we get a thaw, it backs right up into the street. And there's no storm, mind you. It's dry. It's been dry for days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So just melt, or water coming from somewhere else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Melt, and whatever else runs down there. Sorry, you're on speaker, I've got my hands full here. I'm sorting a stack of coupons my sister handed me and they're all over the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:05:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:05:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anyway, the sidewalk in front is a sheet of mud and grit. Every time it backs up it leaves all that behind. You can't walk without tracking it into the building. My tenants are not thrilled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:05:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I bet. And that's 292 Bridge, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:05:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "292 Bridge Street. Two, nine, two. Not 229, people always flip it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 292. Thank you for correcting me before I typed it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm. So what I want to know is when they last came by. When was that drain last cleaned out? Because it sure doesn't look like this year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:06:01-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the work history for that location. Give me a second. [pause] I'm seeing the street in the system, but I'd want to confirm the last cleaning date with the crew supervisor rather than read you the wrong entry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:06:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not from my screen, no. What I can do is put in a service request for the drain to be inspected and cleared, and have somebody call you back with the last date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:06:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Do that. And note it's the one right in front of the house, at the curb, not the one at the corner. The corner one is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In front of 292, at the curb, not the corner. Okay. And is the water standing there for long, or does it go down eventually?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:06:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes down eventually, slowly. By the afternoon it's mostly gone and leaves the grit. Then the next warm morning, same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:07:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Best number for the call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:07:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:07:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0171. I've got that. They're usually back to people within a few business days, but I can't promise the hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:07:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days is fine as long as somebody actually comes and looks. I'd like to see a truck, frankly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mark that you want the drain cleared and the sidewalk noted as well, so they see the mud when they come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:07:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Brownell. Enjoy the coupons."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T13:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hardly. Bye now."
    }
  ],
